diff --git a/changelog.d/private-writer-consolidation.md b/changelog.d/private-writer-consolidation.md
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/private-writer-consolidation.md
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+- **Private state and credential transactions share one atomic replacement boundary.** Catalogs, client configuration, provider state, generated router secrets, gateway files, skill ownership, migration manifests, and Windows launchers avoid duplicate Windows ACL helper launches while preserving their bytes and owner-only permissions. Kimi refresh retains fsync; profile copies retain exclusive copying and symlink checks; caller-key rotation retains protected backups and rollback generations; existing router keys still receive ACL repair. Custom protection callbacks retain both checks, cleanup preserves its diagnostics, and exclusive-create collisions or raced paths never authorize deleting another writer's temporary file.
